 Unfortunatly, 3.2c can't set the date past 1999.

 
What did work, however, was using ntp to get/set from a free server.
 
Also suggested, (didn't try it but it should work):
 
Try

1) Set date to Dec31 1999, 23:59

2) Wait for 2 min to allow system to switch to 1Jan 2000

3) Set the date to Dec31 [Do Not set the year]

4) Wait for 2 min to allow system to switch to 1Jan 2001

 

 

Thanks again

George

