Hi,

We had the same problem. The problem is caused by the fact that collect
locks memory pages needed for dumps. There is no patch available yet. (Can't
install patch-kits anyway in this state) However, there is a workaround:

"With the  latest version collect which i got from guru, start it with the
-ol argument."  (from Compaq-engineering)

You should stop collect (if you have a hanging dump, it will continue), move
collect to collect.old and replace it with the version included in this
mail. Make sure permissions are the same as those of the old collect. Then
restart collect with the -ol options (VERY important!).

Your problems should be solved after that.

If you run collect automatically, make sure you add the -ol options in
/etc/rc.config-settings from collect on both members.

Good luck!



With kind regards,

Dagmar Galama

