The messages to me was that umask and chmod use the opposite
specifications.

umask 077
#
#    -rwx------      Owner: permit - read, write, execute(search) 
#                    Group: prevent all access
#                    World: prevent all access

is equilvant to chmod 700

I also found a url from the Tru64 documentation wich explained it pretty
good.
