When I log in as root it won't even open up the GUI interface to add user.
click on it and it asks if you want to use it as the logged in name or root.
Either choice (when logged in as root) is root and the gui never opens.  

I have tried to start dxaccounts from the command line and it says the the
passwd and group files are locked by another user.  This server is used for
training purposes so the need is not critical. It is used by myself and one
other person.......


Any insight or suggestion to resolve this issue would be appriciated.  I
