have made the requested kernal changes for "ubc" values, and the errors
continue.  I know of 1 other site with similar issue in the uk for whom a
special patch has been developed specifically for ubc "slte" panics.  All
good admins need to weigh the pain of the crash verses the possible pain of
the unknown system changes.  I was attempting to test the waters of this
group, and/or the intimacies you each may have encountered with "slte"
panics.  I was hoping to have many of you know about this patch, and state
you were using it with success.  Now I must go back, review the facts, and
make my decision. thank you.


